Summary of modifications made by the ViscosityCode contributors:
  - Renamed the product to ViscosityCode with its own install identity
    (app ID, data folders, desktop command line, installer registry keys).
  - Replaced the user interface theme and layout with a Cursor-inspired
    design; the agent engine (supervisor, runtimes, persistence) is
    Poracode's.
  - Disabled update checks, release downloads, and other online services
    that would contact the Poracode project, unless the builder configures
    a ViscosityCode release feed.

